{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Our first game is now available on Steam!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After <strong>6 years of development</strong>, from the first concept to the final release, we proudly present <strong>RazePact</strong> \u2014 a game made entirely in <strong>Construct 2</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>RazePact</strong> combines the best of classics like <strong>Mega Man X4 and X5</strong> with the fast-paced action of <strong>hack n\u2019 slash</strong> combat and the nostalgic charm of games like <strong>Grand Chase</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll control <strong>Soul</strong>, a small wandering spirit searching for answers within a <strong>dark dungeon full of mysteries</strong>. With each battle, you grow stronger \u2014 and closer to uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Throughout this world, you\u2019ll find <strong>various upgrades</strong> and <strong>unique altar mechanics</strong> that enhance your abilities as you progress.<br>Activate mechanisms, overcome challenges, and face <strong>epic boss battles</strong> that will truly test your skill and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 The fights are intense and challenging, but you\u2019ll have <strong>well-placed checkpoints</strong> to bring you back close to where you fell \u2014 no need to replay entire stages or start over like in some roguelikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 We hope you <strong>enjoy exploring this universe</strong> and don\u2019t forget to <strong>leave a review on Steam</strong> to share your thoughts about the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br> <br> <br> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Soul in Collapse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/03445814680035013269a4297706026f2276f640.jpg"},{"name":"Twisted Revenge!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/b40da42a41bf740f789664e3b8a004c8c234b08c.jpg"},{"name":"How about a little Potion? ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/d5efb6782654758fca2505812b42391343d393f3.jpg"},{"name":"Greedy Vase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/0cd0e1a2088e66b272c993b877f8c22375bf95a9.jpg"},{"name":"Lancer Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/2f2f76aa03fa6fd1b17ac79f5fcde71538cd1b30.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Soul!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/2942d6fac2115ff69f8af3025151cb4f5aaf8e51.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer of the Vulture King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/25dd457fd449ee5886358a799c9b5bcdb475ad07.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer of the HellRider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/d1c4d6e87a5d721c36e8f48c9d715e64cf71f16c.jpg"},{"name":" Slayer of Trigon ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/f53197386a92a193ee858d277e98c9fc1947a8cf.jpg"},{"name":"The Strongest Dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3253190/8b01053f2c93173c4ada469d4fe6b71c66091073.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3253190?t=1768971349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3253190?t=1768971349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253190/196d8f94c53f2a5d4d1e48b95b8b29e6bfda3925/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768971349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253190/196d8f94c53f2a5d4d1e48b95b8b29e6bfda3925/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768971349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Our first game is now available on Steam!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After <strong>6 years of development</strong>, from the first concept to the final release, we proudly present <strong>RazePact</strong> \u2014 a game made entirely in <strong>Construct 2</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>RazePact</strong> combines the best of classics like <strong>Mega Man X4 and X5</strong> with the fast-paced action of <strong>hack n\u2019 slash</strong> combat and the nostalgic charm of games like <strong>Grand Chase</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll control <strong>Soul</strong>, a small wandering spirit searching for answers within a <strong>dark dungeon full of mysteries</strong>. With each battle, you grow stronger \u2014 and closer to uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Throughout this world, you\u2019ll find <strong>various upgrades</strong> and <strong>unique altar mechanics</strong> that enhance your abilities as you progress.<br>Activate mechanisms, overcome challenges, and face <strong>epic boss battles</strong> that will truly test your skill and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 The fights are intense and challenging, but you\u2019ll have <strong>well-placed checkpoints</strong> to bring you back close to where you fell \u2014 no need to replay entire stages or start over like in some roguelikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 We hope you <strong>enjoy exploring this universe</strong> and don\u2019t forget to <strong>leave a review on Steam</strong> to share your thoughts about the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragra